cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Mol-Metal in academic work, please cite the Tier-2 paper
  (forthcoming) and acknowledge the framework per AGENTS.md §0.4. Citation
  metadata below is for software use; the paper will carry the canonical
  Tier-2 journal reference once published.
type: software
title: "Mol-Metal"
abstract: >-
  Hybrid molecular λ-calculus + flow-matching framework for precious-metal
  anticancer drug design (Pt/Ru/Ir/Au/Pd) on top of Flow Matching + Structure-
  Based Drug Design + Lambda Calculus MCTS proof-search. Tier-2 computational
  ship surface per AGENTS.md §5.4 (no wet-lab planning).
keywords:
  - flow-matching
  - molecular-lambda-calculus
  - structure-based-drug-design
  - precious-metal
  - anticancer
  - drug-design
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Hugo
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hugo-Lee/mol-metal"
url: "https://github.com/Hugo-Lee/mol-metal"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
version: "0.1.0"
